        "name": "GeoLocation: permit a named place with no coordinates",
        "spec_text_today": "CATDEF_SPEC section 'GeoLocation Type': 'At minimum, lat and lng must be present. address and label are optional display strings.'",
        "proposed_shape": "Require at least one of (lat AND lng) OR (label OR address). lat/lng remain required together.",
        "thingalog_interim": "NONE — this is the point. v.location is Thingalog's canonical store and already carries the name-only state; there is no interim because the state cannot cross the wire at all. The data exists and is simply dropped on export.",
